wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$15/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$180/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$225/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.27.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 19th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Magma</b> tree is a fiery tree that grows in the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magma Cave\">Magma Caves</a>, located in the lower section of <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>. Like <a href=\"/wiki/Plek\" title=\"Plek\">Plek</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>, Magma trees are incredibly valuable due to how difficult it is to obtain, requiring the successful navigation of the precarious and deadly Magma Caves.    \n</p><p>It can be identified by its irregularly shaped burnt black trunk and glowing neon orange leaves.    \n</p><p>Magma trees require an <a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Sander\" title=\"Industrial Sander\">Industrial Sander</a> to be sanded, however, it only requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Planker\" title=\"Steel Planker\">Steel Planker</a> to plank. It may be more efficient to buy a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Saw\" title=\"Refined Saw\">Refined Saw</a> at first to process your first few Magma trees.    \n</p><p><b>Requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a> or greater.</b>   \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>Magma trees are found in the Magma Caves, located behind a wall in Mikes Mines that that can be broken with explosives. Magma Trees also spawn at the site of a <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor\" title=\"Meteor\">Meteor Crater</a>, typically spawning 2 trees.   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"372fd5e5701d0aaf753f1ff28a743f42\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Magma_Log_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Magma_Log_Texture.png\" title=\"Magma Log Texture.png (540 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/Magma_Log_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240723063242\" title=\"Magma Log Texture.png (540 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Magma Log Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Log_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Magma Log Texture.png (540 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Magma Log Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Log_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/Magma_Log_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240723063242\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Log</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Magma_Refined_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Magma_Refined_Texture.png\" title=\"Magma Refined Texture.png (263 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Magma_Refined_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240723063209\" title=\"Magma Refined Texture.png (263 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Magma Refined Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Refined_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Magma Refined Texture.png (263 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Magma Refined Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Refined_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Magma_Refined_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240723063209\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Magma_Planked_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Magma_Planked_Texture.png\" title=\"Magma Planked Texture.png (505 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Magma_Planked_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240723062246\" title=\"Magma Planked Texture.png (505 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Magma Planked Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Planked_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Magma Planked Texture.png (505 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Magma Planked Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Planked_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Magma_Planked_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240723062246\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Magma tree is one of the few trees that have had their main spawn location moved, having previously been located around the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>. Their location was moved as a result of the map revamp on 21/07/2023.</li>\n<li>Magma trees are currently one of the better ways to farm cash, with a full grown, multi-branched tree selling for ~$20-30K if sanded and planked. However, due to spawning in a dangerous and tedious location and trees falling in the lava causing losses, farming Mysterious Mushrooms can be an easier method of farming money.</li>\n<li>The easiest way to access Magma trees is to find them from <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor\" title=\"Meteor\">Meteors</a>. Each meteor produces 2 trees, and can be sold for a lot of quick cash.</li>\n<li>Due to its unique neon orange color, sanded Magma tree is ideal for use in builds that involve lava-like elements or neon lighting.</li>\n<li>The Magma tree used to have opaque leaves, but they became translucent after the map revamp.</li>\n<li>Magma tree leaves become lighter in color as colder seasons approach.</li>\n<li>There is a bug that can generate double trunk Magma trees. Hese bugged trees require chopping both trunks to take it down. This bug often occurs with Magma trees spawned from a meteor crash site.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Magma Tree (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6TWFnbWFfVHJlZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Magma_Tree\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Magma_Tree?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; f